. The son of Nun, of the tribe of Ephraim, the successor of Moses as the leader of Israel.","verses":189,"father":"Nun","mother":"","v":[17]},{"id":"nun_2214","name":"Nun","also":"Non","summary":"Beyond the fact that he was the father of Joshua nothing more is known of him (Ex. 33:11).","verses":30,"father":"Elishama","mother":"","v":[17]}],"places":[{"id":"water_gate_1230","name":"water gate","kind":"Landmark","lat":31.77744,"lon":35.23494,"summary":"The fruit of a species of palm, the Phoenix dactilifera. This was a common tree in Palestine (Joel 1:12; Neh. 8:15).","verses":4,"v":[1,3,16]},{"id":"jerusalem_636","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"City","lat":31.77667,"lon":35.23417,"summary":"Called also Salem, Ariel, Jebus, the “city of God,” the “holy city;” by the modern Arabs el-Khuds, meaning “the holy;” once “the city of Judah” (2 Chr. 25:28).","verses":754,"v":[15]},{"id":"gate_of_ephraim_438","name":"gate of Ephraim","kind":"Landmark (Gate)","lat":31.77744,"lon":35.23494,"summary":"","verses":2,"v":[16]}],"events":[],"traditions":[],"sources":["JFB","MHCC","Wesley"],"tags":{"bsb":[[3605,3605,3605,3605,5971,5971,622,376,413,7339,7339,6440,4325,4325,8179,559,559,559,5830,5608,5608,935,935,935,5612,5612,8451,8451,8451,4872,4872,834,3068,3068,6680,6680,853,3478],[259,259,259,3117,7637,7637,7637,2320,5830,3548,3548,935,8451,8451,6440,6951,6951,376,376,5704,802,3605,3605,8085,8085,8085,995,995],[7121,7121,7121,0,0,4480,216,5704,4276,6440,6440,6440,7339,7339,6440,4325,4325,8179,5048,5048,5048,582,582,802,802,995,995,995,995,995,3605,3605,5971,5971,241,241,241,5612,5612,8451,8451,8451],[5830,5608,5608,5975,5921,6086,6086,6086,4026,6213,1697,1697,1697,5921,5921,3225,3225,5975,4993,8087,6043,223,2518,4641,4641,8040,8040,8040,8040,6305,6305,4332,4441,2828,2806,2148,4918,4918],[5830,6605,5612,5612,5869,5869,5869,3605,3605,5971,5971,3588,1961,1961,5921,5921,5921,3605,6605,6605,6605,6605,6605,3605,5971,5971,5975,5975],[5830,5830,1288,3068,3068,1419,1419,430,3027,3027,3027,3027,4